=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Hungry Wolf} inside the Craftmen's Eatery to start the quest. (Use {p:Home Point} #1.)
** **(Optional)** Speak to {p:Offa} at {z:Bastok Markets} (F-10) (second floor, door on the left) for instructions on how to make the sausage.
* Obtain a {@i:G. Sheep Meat|4372} {i:Giant Sheep Meat|G. Sheep Meat|4372} from the {z:Auction House} or from {m:Ornery Sheep} in {z:South Gustaberg} (or elsewhere.)
